  <title>Hypothesis Testing for Quantitative Data</title>

  <introduction>
    <p> Students learn how to do a hypothesis test for one mean using bootstrapping as the simulation method. 
      In addition, this chapter introduces new ways to summarize quantitative data.
    </p>
